title: "CDACF Simulation: a stability-governed controller for cross-domain consensus selection"
abstract: >-
  Simulation code, seeds, analysis scripts and result files for the CDACF consensus
  selection controller, evaluated across two calibrated IoT domain profiles, thirteen
  out-of-distribution configurations and one held-out profile.
